		LongVT tool-call trajectories on ten video benchmarks


18,407 supervised trajectories in the LongVT SFT format
(messages, read by lmms-engine's qwen3_vl_iterable dataset), uploaded in three batches:

batch 1 (2026-10-31): 5,618 rows on LVBench, LongVideoBench, Video-MME and Video-MMMU, data/train.parquet;
batch 2 (2026-11-05): 7,327 rows on CG-Bench, NExT-GQA, TVQA-Long, TVBench and ALLVB, data/train_batch2.parquet;
batch 3 (2026-11-09): 5,462 rows on CG-Bench and NExT-GQA… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Eustia1/longvt-label-4bench-luna6.
